Z||000000||sid1200||01-30-2000||05:00 AM||||Hi all my 26k GT has developed a disturbing problem<P>1. it ran smoothly and then suddenly would start vibrating a little when I changed gears.. within 5 miles this became constant<BR>and <BR>I lost  about 50% of my power, also it runs very rough vibrates a lot idle is rough anywhere from 550-950 rpms all over the place.<P>my friend  62k 87 GT has the exact same problem.. engine is also very loud<P>before it was running perfect with no problems<P>also this happened right after it got new shocks /struts installed athough I don't think its connected<BR>please help<P>no check engine lights, recent tune up/dist cap. etc||||reg||1
Z||000001||Luperman||01-30-2000||06:37 AM||||have you checked for any vacuum leaks ? maybe something got knocked off .||||reg||5
Z||000002||David Gamache||01-31-2000||03:05 PM||||If the engine suddenly got louder did the rpms increase? If it did you may have the typical cracked egr cross over tube( that insulated tube that goes from the egr to below the front of the underside of the intake. It is hard to spot because the insulating wrap hides cracks. ||||reg||1
